    "text": "KHQ Right Now\nwebsite\nShoshone County, Idaho\nShoshone County Sheriff’s Office loses email capability due to host company’s data breach\nBy Caleb McGever NonStop Local Digital Producer,10 hours ago\nSHOSHONE COUNTY, Idaho – Shoshone County Sheriff’s Office (SCSO) has not had a functioning email for the last few days, according to an update they released today. Their email went down late last week, they said, and there is no timeline yet for it to come back online.\nComments\nLoading editor...",
